    "detailed_description": "It's a sad day for us all as we look back on the year 2222 A.D. and see what has become of our beloved Earth.<br>We're on a great big adventure, looking for a new planet to call home.<br><br>I'm so excited to tell you about this amazing journey you're about to embark on! You're going to be traveling in a spaceship.<br>The spaceship is growing and changing, and it needs a special kind of fuel to keep going. This fuel is in the form of a ring called a &quot;wakka.&quot;<br><br>As you journey through the cosmos, keep your eyes on the prize: a new star to collect some &quot;wakka&quot; along the way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2>The controls are really simple, so don't worry!<br>To raise the spaceship, just press the button. When you release it, gravity will pull the spaceship down. Collect &quot;wakka&quot; while avoiding walls and obstacles. <br><br>There are two game modes: &quot;Stage Mode&quot; and &quot;Endless Mode.&quot; <br>You can use the wakka you've collected in the in-game SHOP. You can customize the game by purchasing wall colors, spaceship types, and backgrounds at the SHOP. <br><br>Experience the simple, yet irresistible world of &quot;WAKKA&quot;!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Live Video Distribution</h2><br>Distribution of gameplay videos, whether by individuals or corporations, is acceptable as long as it adheres to our guidelines.<br>Live game play/distribution of content that contains slander or is offensive to public order and morals is prohibited.<br>D.O. Inc. assumes no responsibility for any damages or problems that may occur through live game play/distribution.<br><br>\u25a0Guidelines for derivative works<br>",
